title: "T-GMLVQ (PyTorch): null-space transfer classification learning"
abstract: >-
  PyTorch reimplementation of Transfer-GMLVQ (T-GMLVQ), a siamese-like GMLVQ for classification
  from multiple sources using null-space evaluation of a shared sub-orthogonal mapping.
